  "meta": {
    "description": "Reusable. Asks the backend for the run plan (the specialists chosen from the REGISTRY, never named here), runs them in parallel batches of plan.max_parallel, and fans in. One specialist failing never fails the run: the backend records it as unavailable and the run continues.",
